# Keep repository contents LF on every platform; this project has no binaries
# except the optional plugin icon (SVG is text) and generated caches (ignored).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
# Real Atlas 0.1 snapshot fixtures are byte-pinned: graph_hash/graph_sha256 and
# prepare-time file hashes are computed over the exact bytes, so git must never
# normalise line endings inside this evidence tree.
evidence/code-view-slice/** -text
